# SUPAFUNDI TRADERS — System Design & UI

## Product
Web POS + business management for **SUPAFUNDI TRADERS** (hardware, wholesale & retail, Tanzania). Professional, fast, trustworthy for **counter tablets/phones**—not generic SaaS.

- **Tagline (visible):** *Hardware Dealership • Wholesale & Retail*
- **Currency:** TZS via `formatTzs()` in `lib/utils/currency.ts` (e.g. `TZS 1,250,000`)
- **Payments:** Cash, M-Pesa, bank transfers are first-class
- **Multi-outlet:** Branch switcher; data scoped per outlet (`useAuthStore`, `updateActiveOutlet`)

## Brand (target — dark-first, orange accent)
| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| Primary | `#f97316` | CTAs, active nav, logo gradient |
| Primary dark | `#ea580c` | Hover |
| Primary light | `#fdba74` | Highlights |
| Background | `#0f172a` | Canvas |
| Card / header | `#1e293b` | Panels, header |
| Surface 1 / 2 | `#334155` / `#475569` | Inputs, secondary buttons |
| Text primary / secondary | `#f1f5f9` / `#94a3b8` | Body / labels |
| Success / Danger / Warning / Info | `#10b981` / `#ef4444` / `#f59e0b` / `#3b82f6` | Semantic |

**Typography:** Segoe UI / system sans; **JetBrains Mono** for money, codes, receipts. **Icons:** Lucide (stroke), 18–24px nav.

**Shape:** radius 4px chips, 8px inputs/buttons, 12–16px cards; 1px `#334155` borders; card shadow `0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)`. Primary buttons: orange **135° gradient**, lift on hover.

> **Theme:** `app/globals.css` `:root` uses this token set; PWA `theme_color` is `#0f172a` in `public/manifest.json` and `app/layout.tsx` viewport.

## Layout shell
1. **Sticky header** — logo, brand, outlet, Reconcile, Open Session, datetime, cashier, sync badge (Synced / Syncing / Offline)
2. **Horizontal tab nav** — scroll on mobile; icon + label
3. **Main** — `PageHeader` (title left, actions/filters right)

**Login:** Centered card, dark gradient, logo + email/password.

**POS desktop:** ~25% expenses | ~45% catalog (search, category, retail/wholesale toggle, grid) | ~30% cart.
**POS mobile:** Stack + FABs for Cart and Expenses with badges.

**Dashboard:** Stat row → cash-session warning → 2-col insight panels.

