## Modules (design targets)
Dashboard, POS, Sales, Invoices (sub-tabs), Inventory, Customers, Suppliers, Payments, Reports (pill tabs + date toolbar), Settings.

**Modals:** cash session open/close, daily reconcile, checkout/payment split, customer statement, invoice CRUD, destructive confirms.

## Component patterns
- **Buttons:** `primary` orange gradient; neutral `action-btn`; green gradient `header-btn` for Reconcile; destructive = red, never orange
- **Forms:** dark fill surface-1, orange focus ring; labels 0.85rem secondary; `form-hint` under complex fields
- **Cards:** `dash-stat-card` / `report-card` — icon in 10% semantic tint circle; net profit hero = green gradient (red if loss)
- **Tables:** dark header, right-align currency (monospace), row icon actions, empty states
- **Nav tabs:** inactive secondary; active primary tint + orange accent; nested `report-tab-btn` / `invoice-tab-btn`
- **Modals:** dim overlay; header + ×; footer Cancel + Primary; receipt preview for print
- **Feedback:** sonner toasts; sync colors (green/blue pulse/amber offline)

## UX (non-negotiable)
1. ≤2 taps to add product; min **44px** touch targets on mobile
2. Prominent warning when cash session closed
3. Obvious retail/wholesale toggle; distinct prices
4. TZS prefix, right-aligned amounts, monospace totals
5. Credit/payables use **warning** styling, visible
6. Sync state always visible
7. Role-based UI (`canManageSettings`, `canUsePos`, etc.)
8. Emoji in section headers OK sparingly; **not** on printed docs

## Responsive
≥1400px full POS 3-col; 992–1199 compressed; ≤768 FABs + 2-col stats; ≤575 single column full-width modals. `prefers-reduced-motion`: no pulse.

## Print
- **80mm receipt:** monospace, B&W, line items, totals, payment, cashier
- **A4 invoice/quote/proforma/delivery:** white page, letterhead, dark theme **not** used on print

## Avoid
Light-default UI, blue SaaS aesthetic, tiny POS card text, admin clutter on POS, non-TZS currency, desktop-only POS without FABs.

